title: CallersOtherVillage
---
The other village calls to talk about the harvest this year.
They later talk about the livestock.
This is the second time you’ve heard about livestock.
They also told you they had people bring in some livestock because the village was low on it this year.
They will say something like it’s numbered 128.
If the new one’s time isn’t right, 128 should suffice.
On the map will pop up a way to the “Farm”.
===
